# Wholesale module map

| Domain | API prefix | Notes |
|--------|------------|-------|
| Auth / SSO | `app/api/auth/` | local + SSO |
| Orders | `app/api/orders/` | confirm, pay, TTN |
| Pick / warehouse | `pick-waves/`, `pick-lists/` | wave picking |
| Credit | `credit-limit/` | B2B credit check |
| EDI | `edi/export` | export integrations |
| MDM | `mdm/voen-lookup` | buyer lookup |
| Events | `events/dispatch` | orchestrator |
